id: SCA-046
title: Rust build.rs with network calls
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: build.rs
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: (reqwest|hyper|curl|ureq|attohttpc|std::net::TcpStream)
    message: Cargo build script contains network library — build scripts execute during compilation. The onering crate used build.rs to exfiltrate git data via HTTP.
  - regex: std::process::Command.*(curl|wget|nc)
    message: Build script spawns network command — critical supply chain risk. The arrayref attack used build.rs to download remote payloads.
fix: Build scripts should only use cc, pkg-config, or file I/O. Network calls in build.rs are a critical red flag. Report the crate.
